redhead hottie the  leader of the excavation team to the  point where chamber and ledo were found  but her ship is attacked by pirates amy  asks leto to help them and he agrees  with the intention of earning their  trust letter boards chamber and  efficiently kills the pirates with no  harm to the hottie ship and crew as amy  and the others watch in shock at  chambers destructive power  amy disapproves of leto's actions and  the leaders of the gargantia discuss the  eventual retaliation they may suffer the  redhead girl brings amy to talk with  ledo and they explain to him the weapons  must only be used as a last resort as  people must rely on each other to  survive in their world after amy  reconciles with ledo a large pirate flea  led by the pira empress launches an  attack and slowly approaches the  gargantia ledo discusses the situation  with the commander's assistant and  agrees to help them once more in  exchange for being accepted aboard the  fleet instructed to defeat the enemies  with no casualties leto disables the  pirate ships in the front lines and  returns to the gargantia to deal with a  sneak attack led by pirate empress  herself piloting her custom  humanoid-shaped mech called the surfing  lobster ledo battles and easily defeats  the pirate empress forcing them to flee  upon being saluted by the crew of the  gargantia ledo is greeted by amy and  replies by thanking her the first native  expression that he'd learned later  letter receives an invoice to pay for  his collateral damage although the  commander's assistant says that he  should be relieved from the living  expenses and the fee of having chamber  aboard while chamber helps the others  work leno is seen sculpting the hidey  house claw that he always carries with  him he gives it to amy who plans to pass  it to her brother later during the day  she takes our mc to see the resident  doctor who explains to him that most of  humankind's old technology is lost thus  it's impossible for the gargantia to  help him return to space after they go  to amy's brother who asks leto about his  life in space it soon starts to rain a  little and leto helps collect rainwater  to replenish the fleet's fresh water  supply amy's brother realizes that ledo  was actually carving a flute as the  little boy plays it leder recalls a long  forgotten memory that makes him cry  after asking the kid to return the flute  to him our mc later wonders if he should  learn more about their surroundings  while chamber mentions that he must  eventually leave it all behind when  returning to his unit ledo takes up work  as a fisherman but he finds himself  unable to pilot a diver mech and sends  chamber to assist the other fishermen  instead since chambers rather messy with  his capture of fish let her board's  chambered to help the other fishermen  properly obtain a nice catch using large  nets later that night amy spent some  time alone with ledo and the two become  closer the following day he does some  salvage work with the red-haired girl  and things go smoothly until an  underwater creature appears as chamber  identifies it as a hideous ledo abandons  his work to confront it he kills the  creature known as a whale squid  considered a sacred animal on the planet  and news of his death spread rumors of  an impending misfortune towards the  gargantia pinyin plans to draft leto  into his crew in order to explore the  uncharted whale squid territory and  salvage its treasures but the redhead  girl tries to deter him after chamber  analyzes that whale squid are indeed  similar to the hidey house leno is  determined to exterminate them all  despite amy and her brother attempting  to change his mind earlier when a huge  number of whale squid are seen  approaching the gargantia fleet  commander orders a temporary shutdown on  all machinery and lights to prevent any  provocation as the whale squid pass  under the gargantia leto ignores amy  when she tries to stop him from fighting  the whale squid but he's forced to stand  down when commander's assistant points a  gun at him until all the whale squid  pass under without any incident the  commander is informed by opinion of his  plan and the ship commander flange  declares his intention to accompany  opinion with his ship as both expressed  their objective to secede from the  gargantia the commander tries to  dissuade them until he suffers a heart  attack before his death he appoints his  assistant as his successor meanwhile  chamber informs letto that he finally  managed to pinpoint the location of  their civilization in space but it may  take thousands of years until someone  picks up their distress signal due to  their current location on earth as the  commander's funeral is held several  ships agreed to follow opinion's plan  and prepare themselves to secede from  the gargantia seeing how much his sister  is suffering with ledo's decision to  leave amy's brother tries to discourage  him from leaving however leto says that  his drive to kill the whale squid also  comes from his desire to protect both  amy and him from the hidey house soon  after a devastated amy watches as the  ship leaves the gargantia with ledo  aboard them leto starts his offensive on  the whale squid nest assisted by  pinion's crew and their barrage of depth  charges obliterating the enemies without  much effort opinion remembers he  witnessed his older brother being killed  by whale squid during a failed mission  to find treasure while investigating an  ancient facility leto finds some records  in a storage box on accessing them he  learns that the hideous were once humans  who underwent heavy genetic  modifications to adapt themselves to a  space environment calling themselves  evolvers viewing their efforts as  blasphemy a faction of humankind  declared war on them leading to their  current conflict after both sides  abandoned earth during the fifth ice age  except for the ancestors to the current  humans and whale squid living on the  planet devastated by this revelation  ledo shouts in despair when chambers  slays a hideo's child with his  permission with all the hideaws in the  area killed pinyon and his crew managed  to salvage rare ancient technology  however pinyin says that his crew has  the right to keep the technology for  themselves sending a radio broadcast to  other fleets to warn them to keep out of  his cruise territory as this broadcast  reaches the gargantia the fleet's  already reorganized and there's concern  that other ships may leave to join  pinion side using an ancient cannon  pinion forces a crew of hostile pirates  to surrender and join his fleet leto  then questions if there's still a need  to keep fighting the hideos after all  they've learned chamber comes to the  conclusion that the galactic alliance  and the hideous simply cannot co-exist  seeing as one side evolved and perfected  their civilization while the other  relinquished civilization altogether  thus their conflict is inevitable  chamber then informs letto about a  transmission from a galactic alliance  vessel as a huge fleet approaches them  leto sees his commander still alive  inside his machine caliber atop the  vessel the commander contacts ledo and  instructs him to return to active duty  upon reuniting with him leder learns  that his commander is struck with some  disease that doesn't allow him to leave  his cockpit when leto tells him that the  hidears are originally humans his  commander reveals that he always knew  that just like the high command of the  galactic alliance despite that he  insists to fight the hideous at all this  time he was organizing a powerful fleet  within the cult militaristic society in  order to rally all the humans on earth  under them pinion is summoned to ledo's  commander fleet surprised to be taken  there by the pirate empress who's now  working under leto's commander then  pinion is approached by the mech caliber  striker x3752  who offers him a post as an engineer 