 meanwhile at the  gargantia the commander uses the special  key to activate an ancient mass driver  stored inside the main ship using it to  bonfire the enemy fleet pinyon evacuates  his crew aboard the salvage vessel and  intends to destroy both the recovered  relics and striker's followers but is  saved at the last second by the pirate  empress ledo and chamber pursue stryker  when she targets the gargantia despite  living a life of sacrifice as a soldier  ledo truly desires to survive and live  with amy chamber then relieves ledo from  duty and ejects him to safety before  destroying striker in a suicide attack  some time later letter has become an  experienced excavator in the wales  square territory and is also in a  relationship with amy that being said we  hope we fulfilled our purpose by making  you entertain don't forget to like  subscribe maybe share and comment until  next time fellas

